{ dg-modules "rcprelude" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Sum of first n cubes", ALGOL 68 solution sum-of-first-n-cubes.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Sum_of_first_n_cubes#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
  License 1.3 (see README.md).  The solution is unchanged in orig/sum-of-first-n-cubes.a68;
  this copy was prepared for ga68 and converted to SUPPER stropping by
  tools/rosetta_prep.py. }
access Rc_Prelude (
{ show the sums of the first n cubes where 0 <= n < 50 }
for i from 0 to 49 do
    int sum = ( i * ( i + 1 ) ) OVER 2;
    print( ( whole( sum * sum, -8 ) ) );
    if i MOD 10 = 9 then print( ( newline ) ) fi
od
)
